Package: omniboot-usb
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sam <sam@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, parted, dosfstools, ntfs-3g, p7zip-full, util-linux, udisks2, policykit-1 | polkitd
Recommends: wimtools
Description: Multi-ISO & Single OS Bootable USB Creator
 OmniBoot USB is a native, modern desktop application for creating bootable
 USB drives for both Linux and Windows.
 .
 Features:
  - First-class Ventoy Multi-ISO support: boot multiple Linux & Windows ISOs
    from a single USB drive.
  - Dedicated Single-ISO direct flash for Linux and Windows installers.
  - Pre-flight storage analysis: compares USB drive capacity against ISO file
    size and prevents flashing if storage is insufficient.
  - Safe USB detection that strictly protects internal system drives and OS
    partitions.
  - Native GTK3 interface (no localhost / no web server).
  - PolicyKit (pkexec) integration for safe administrative execution.
